shadow-d24.patch (2026-10-24, branch fix/shadow-d24): toolkit changes on top of the toolkit patch of main 054a158.

PS3RECOMP_ENG_SHADOW_D24 (live, DIAGNOSTIC, default 0 = unchanged): the sun-shadow compare at the
map's fixed-point precision (1), filter-then-compare (2), ties pass (3), 2-step bias (4); the shadow
descriptor gains grid/mode bytes (part of the program key). Apply with: git apply -p1 inside ps3recomp-fork/.

